{"id":"batalla","lemma":"batalla","pos":"noun","rank":895,"glosses":["battle"],"ipa":"/baˈtaʝa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"batallas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-batalla.wav","formAudio":{"batallas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-batallas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ellos murieron en el campo de batalla.","en":"They died in battle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449068","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"countryside, country"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Yo solo puedo pelear mis batallas.","en":"I can fight my battles myself.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to fight"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Fue herido en la batalla.","en":"He was wounded in the battle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531848","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"hurt, injured"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Puedes ganar todas las batallas, pero perder la guerra.","en":"You can win all the battles yet lose the war.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606735","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to gain"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"to lose"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"war, warfare"}]},{"text":"Éste es el lugar donde tuvo lugar la batalla.","en":"This is the place where the battle took place.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537864","words":[{"g":"this one"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"by, near to"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}